# Anthropic API key — required for feedback generation.
# Get one at https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
# Locally this goes in .env.local (gitignored). On Vercel, set it in
# Project Settings → Environment Variables — never commit it to the repo.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional. Which model marks the work. Defaults to claude-opus-5.
# Competition maths needs a model that reads handwriting *and* reasons
# rigorously, so this is the main quality lever in the app:
#   claude-opus-5    — the default; strongest on olympiad/STEP proof
#   claude-sonnet-5  — roughly half the price and faster; good for routine marking
#   claude-haiku-4-5 — cheapest, for quick checks only
# MATH_TUTOR_MODEL=
